Package: voltbill
Version: 2.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Akshar Miyani <https://github.com/miyaniakshar1234/VoltBill>
Homepage: https://github.com/miyaniakshar1234/VoltBill
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.27)
Description: High-Performance Utility Distribution & Grid Analytics Engine in Native C
 VoltBill is an enterprise-grade utility distribution engine and customer management
 system written in native ISO C. Engineered under strict systems programming invariants,
 VoltBill delivers deterministic sub-microsecond calculation latency, TrueColor ANSI TUI,
 solar net-metering, industrial power factor calculation, Time-of-Day tariffs, and
 authentic phone-scannable ISO/IEC 18004 QR generation.
